# SPA fallback - Functions are automatically excluded by Netlify
#
# Old domains forward to the primary domain thepalaciocollection.com (301, path and query string are kept).
# Function URLs stay reachable on the old address so existing calendar (iCal) subscriptions and webhooks keep working.
https://www.paradisevillascostarica.com/.netlify/functions/*  /.netlify/functions/:splat  200!
https://www.paradisevillascostarica.com/*  https://thepalaciocollection.com/:splat  301!

/pricing-guide-view-house.html  /pricing-guide-view-house.html  200

